@api = http://localhost:5080/api/vikingos

### Listar todos
GET {{api}}
Accept: application/json

### Crear
POST {{api}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Bjorn",
  "batallasGanadas": 85,
  "armaFavorita": "Espada",
  "nivelHonor": "Alto",
  "causaMuerte": "DueloUnoContraUno"
}

### Crear inválido (debe responder 400)
POST {{api}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "",
  "batallasGanadas": -5
}

### Actualizar (reemplazar el id)
PUT {{api}}/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Bjorn Ironside",
  "batallasGanadas": 90,
  "armaFavorita": "Hacha",
  "nivelHonor": "Alto",
  "causaMuerte": "BatallaCampoAbierto"
}

### Eliminar (reemplazar el id)
DELETE {{api}}/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
